{"resourceIdentifier":"3338","resourceName":"Yan’an Wuqi Afforestation Project","description":"Yan’an Wuqi Afforestation Project (hereafter 'The Project') is located in Wuqi County, Yan’an City, Shaanxi Region, China. The project aims to increase the carbon sequestration and to contribute to local sustainable development through planting the trees on the barren land or barren mountain.\r\n45,661.91 ha of forest is to be planted by direct planting on barren land and barren mountain in Wuqi county, there are 4 species selected as designated tree species, they are Robinia pseudoacacia, Armeniaca sibirica, Prunus davidiana and Pinus tabuliformis, the planted trees are all native species. The implementation of the afforestation project will generate GHG emission removals and improve the Wuqi county’s local environment, about 3,791,500.00 ha enhance the capabilities of local communities and residents by providing them with relevant technical skills and training and increase local biodiversity as a result of establishing a forest of native trees.","location":{"latitude":36.880844,"longitude":108.028790},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-18","endExclusive":"2022-12-19","endInclusive":"2022-12-18"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3338"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shaanxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"National Forestry and Grassland Administration Northwest Investigation and Planning Institute"},{"type":"string","value":"Shaanxi, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"356695"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[